<view class="page {{themeClass}}"><view class="hint">平台替你准备的经营规则，需由你逐项核对。确认后由平台应用；不会在这里锁工资、发薪或办理收款。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card">正在读取…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="card"><text>{{error}}</text><button bindtap="load">重新读取</button></view><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{!drafts.length}}" class="card">目前没有需要你确认的配置。</view><view wx:for="{{drafts}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="hint">{{item.ownerConfirmed?'你已确认，等待平台应用':'待你核对'}}</view><view wx:for="{{item.changes}}" wx:for-item="r" wx:key="key" class="change"><view>{{r.label}}</view><view class="before">当前：{{r.before}}</view><view class="after">拟改为：{{r.after}}</view></view><view class="hint">需要修改的内容</view><view class="feedback-box"><textarea class="feedback" data-id="{{item.id}}" value="{{item.feedback}}" bindinput="feedback" maxlength="2000" placeholder="退回时请写明哪一项需要调整" placeholder-class="feedback-placeholder"/></view><checkbox-group data-id="{{item.id}}" bindchange="check"><label><checkbox value="checked" checked="{{item.checked}}" disabled="{{item.ownerConfirmed}}"/>我已核对以上变更</label></checkbox-group><button class="review-primary" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-action="confirm" bindtap="review" disabled="{{!!busy || item.ownerConfirmed}}">确认这些规则</button><button class="review-secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-action="reject" bindtap="review" disabled="{{!!busy}}">退回平台重新整理</button></view></block><view class="title">配置交付与后续修改</view><view class="hint">已应用记录表示平台曾完成配置；当前值以商家对应页面为准。</view><view wx:for="{{delivery}}" wx:key="module" class="card"><view class="title">{{item.title}}</view><view>{{item.enabled?(item.appliedAt?'平台已配置 · '+item.appliedText:'本次尚未应用'):'未开通'}}</view><view class="hint">{{item.statusText}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.note}}">{{item.note}}</view><view>{{item.rights}}</view><view class="hint">{{item.entry}}</view></view></view>
